{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Locked Together is a horror experience inspired by escape rooms.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, dive into the first level &quot;Arcade Room,&quot; and get an exclusive preview of the experience that awaits in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707680/extras/levelsGif.gif?t=1746532750\" />Face the challenge alone or with friends in co-op. Solve the puzzles and find your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707680/extras/CoopGif.gif?t=1746532750\" />Examine and interact with items as you try to unravel the mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707680/extras/ItemsGif.gif?t=1746532750\" />Leave a review, and if you'd like to be part of the development process, join the <strong>Discord</strong>. Don\u2019t forget to wishlist the game \u2013 <strong>feedback is appreciated!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Disclaimer</strong>: This game is in continuous development, and you may encounter bugs in the demo. Thank you for your patience and support!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3707680?t=1746532750","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3707680?t=1746532750","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707680/244405fa6f1b63150b28e615f9fb581263e90430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746532750","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707680/244405fa6f1b63150b28e615f9fb581263e90430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746532750","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-pla